Derived work in this repository, with the nature of the derivation:

  src/shared/storage/indexedDbStore.ts
      Derived from mixpanel-js `src/storage/indexed-db.js`. The open/init
      promise-caching structure and the non-fatal failure posture follow that
      implementation; the TypeScript, the per-record API and the transactional
      removeItems() are original.

  src/shared/storage/persistentStore.ts
      Derived from mixpanel-js `src/storage/wrapper.js`. The
      IndexedDB-with-localStorage-fallback pattern and its one-way fallback
      policy follow that implementation; the interface and code are original.

  src/shared/privacy/gdpr.ts
      Derived from mixpanel-js `src/gdpr-utils.js`. The consent decision table is
      that file's: which signals count as an opt-out, that a browser DNT flag
      outranks a stored opt-in, that only an opt-IN emits a tracking callback, and
      that a failed consent *read* must not break the caller. Retains the Apache
      License header. Deliberate divergences (no per-token keying, no
      persistenceType, once-per-page notices, addOptOutCheck* not ported) are
      documented in the file itself.

  src/shared/privacy/doNotTrackSignals.ts
      Derived from mixpanel-js `src/gdpr-utils.js` `_hasDoNotTrackFlagOn`. The
      three-property check (navigator.doNotTrack / navigator.msDoNotTrack /
      window.doNotTrack) and the accepted-truthy value set (true, 1, '1', 'yes')
      are that implementation's; GPC support, the TypeScript and the never-throw
      posture are original.

  tests/unit/setup.ts
      Adapted from mixpanel-js `tests/unit/jsdom-setup.js`.

The eTLD+1 heuristic in src/shared/publicSuffix.ts was informed by the approach
in mixpanel-js `src/utils.js` (extract_domain), but shares no code with it.

